# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Activate a Blood token by paying mana, tapping it, discarding a card, and sacrificing it to draw.
# Forcing: The scripted path must first create the token, then its activation is the only action that produces the required zone changes and draw.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no decisions or relevant permanents; every player choice is supplied by the acceptance script.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = The Blood ability resolves, the token and discard leave their zones, and Lightning Bolt is drawn.
#   LOSE = Token creation, activation, payment, source identity, or resolution failed before the turn limit.
#   TIMEOUT = A cost or priority prompt did not complete.
# Card roles:
#   Voldaren Epicure — creates the Blood token through ordinary gameplay.
#   Mountain — pays for the spell and activation; the hand copy pays the discard cost.
#   Lightning Bolt — deterministic draw result proving the activation resolved.
# Protocol path: Cast and token creation, activated-action offer, cost selection, ability stack lifecycle, and draw resolution.

[metadata]
Name:Blood Token Activation
Goal:Survive
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Create and activate a Blood token, discard Mountain, sacrifice the token, and draw Lightning Bolt.

